#. Content of the 'about' (HTML) field in DocType 'Product Bundle'
#: erpnext/selling/doctype/product_bundle/product_bundle.json:66
msgid ""
"<h3>About Product Bundle</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Aggregate group of <b>Items</b> into another <b>Item</b>. This is useful "
"if you are bundling a certain <b>Items</b> into a package and you maintain "
"stock of the packed <b>Items</b> and not the aggregate <b>Item</b>.</p>\n"
"<p>The package <b>Item</b> will have <code>Is Stock Item</code> as <b>No</b> "
"and <code>Is Sales Item</code> as <b>Yes</b>.</p>\n"
"<h4>Example:</h4>\n"
"<p>If you are selling Laptops and Backpacks separately and have a special "
"price if the customer buys both, then the Laptop + Backpack will be a new "
"Product Bundle Item.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>製品バンドルについて</h3>\n"
"\n"
"<p>複数の<b>アイテム</b>を別の<b>アイテム</b>にまとめます。特定の<b>アイテム"
"</b>をパッケージにまとめ、パッケージ内の個別<b>アイテム</b>の在庫を管理する場"
"合に便利です。</p>\n"
"<p>パッケージの<b>アイテム</b>は<code>在庫アイテム</code>が<b>いいえ</b>、"
"<code>販売アイテム</code>が<b>はい</b>となります。</p>\n"
"<h4>例：</h4>\n"
"<p>ノートPCとバックパックを別々に販売しており、両方購入する顧客に特別価格を提"
"供する場合、ノートPC＋バックパックが新しい製品バンドルアイテムとなります。</"
"p>"

#. Content of the 'Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Currency Exchange Settings'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/currency_exchange_settings/currency_exchange_settings.json:51
#, fuzzy, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<h3>Currency Exchange Settings Help</h3>\n"
"<p>There are 3 variables that could be used within the endpoint, result key "
"and in values of the parameter.</p>\n"
"<p>Exchange rate between {from_currency} and {to_currency} on "
"{transaction_date} is fetched by the API.</p>\n"
"<p>Example: If your endpoint is exchange.com/2021-08-01, then, you will have "
"to input exchange.com/{transaction_date}</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h3>通貨交換設定ヘルプ</h3>\n"
"<p>エンドポイント、結果キー、およびパラメータの値内で使用できる変数は3つあり"
"ます。</p>\n"
"<p>APIによって、{transaction_date} の {from_currency} と {to_currency} の間の"
"為替レートが取得されます。</p>\n"
"<p>例: エンドポイントが exchange.com/2021-08-01 の場合、exchange.com/"
"{transaction_date} と入力する必要があります。</p>"

#. Content of the 'Body and Closing Text Help' (HTML) field in DocType
#. 'Dunning
#. Letter Text'
#: erpnext/accounts/doctype/dunning_letter_text/dunning_letter_text.json:56
#, fuzzy, python-format, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<h4>Body Text and Closing Text Example</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<div>We have noticed that the following payments, totaling {{ currency }} "
"{{ total_outstanding }}, are overdue:</div>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"{% for row in overdue_payments %}\n"
"<li>Invoice {{ row.sales_invoice }}: {{ currency }} {{ row.outstanding }}, "
"due on {{ row.due_date }}.</li>\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<div>Please pay the amount due immediately to avoid any further dunning cost."
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>How to get fieldnames</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>The fieldnames you can use in your template are the fields in the "
"document. You can find out the fields of any documents via Setup &gt; "
"Customize Form View and selecting Dunning or Overdue Payment for the payment "
"rows</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>Templating</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more "
"about Jinja, <a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/"
"templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
msgstr ""
"<h4>本文と結びのテキスト例</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<div>合計 {{ currency }} {{ total_outstanding }} の以下の支払いが期限超過して"
"いることに気づきました:</div>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"{% for row in overdue_payments %}\n"
"<li>請求書 {{ row.sales_invoice }}: {{ currency }} {{ row.outstanding }}、期"
"日 {{ row.due_date }}。</li>\n"
"{% endfor %}\n"
"</ul>\n"
"<div>これ以上の督促費用を避けるため、直ちに期日までの金額をお支払いください。"
"</div>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>フィールド名の取得方法</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>テンプレートで使用できるフィールド名は、ドキュメント内のフィールドです。任"
"意のドキュメントのフィールドは、設定 > フォームビューのカスタマイズで、支払い"
"行に対して督促状または期限超過支払を選択することで確認できます。</p>\n"
"\n"
"<h4>テンプレート作成</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<p>テンプレートはJinjaテンプレート言語を使用してコンパイルされます。Jinjaの詳"
"細については、<a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/"
"templates/\">このドキュメントをお読みください。</a></p>"

#. Content of the 'Contract Template Help' (HTML) field in DocType 'Contract
#. Template'
#: erpnext/crm/doctype/contract_template/contract_template.json:55
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h4>Contract Template Example</h4>\n"
"\n"
"<pre>Contract for Customer {{ party_name }}\n"
